  "pritheebecareful.ponder.reinforcement_anvil.header": "Blacksmithing: Reinforcement Anvil",
  "pritheebecareful.ponder.reinforcement_anvil.text_1": "The Reinforcement Anvil is used for metalworking, which includes initiating, hammering, folding, and applying reinforce items to gear",
  "pritheebecareful.ponder.reinforcement_anvil.text_2": "Place gear primary parts onto the anvil and right click with a Titanite Shard to initiate a Reinforce Item",
  "pritheebecareful.ponder.reinforcement_anvil.text_3": "While the Reinforce Item is still unfinished, you can right click it with successively higher titanites to increase its reinforce level",
  "pritheebecareful.ponder.reinforcement_anvil.text_4": "When a Reinforce Item is heated to sufficient malleability, right click it with a Wrench to hammer xp into it",
  "pritheebecareful.ponder.reinforcement_anvil.text_5": "When a Reinforce Item has hit a progress wall, right click it with a Titanite Shard to fold it, provided you have enough of the gear's material ingots in your inventory",
  "pritheebecareful.ponder.reinforcement_anvil.text_6": "With a finished Reinforce Item in hand, place the gear item onto the anvil and right click the anvil with the Reinforce Item to apply it",
